  {
    "key": "franco corelli",
    "name": "Franco Corelli",
    "slots": {
      "origin": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "Franco Corelli 是義大利男高音，1921 年 4 月 8 日生於安科納，2003 年過世。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franco_Corelli",
            "src2": "https://www.baltimoresun.com/news/bs-xpm-2003-10-31-0310310257-story.html",
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "他的父親是義大利海軍的造船工，家在亞得里亞海邊；祖父曾在 35 歲辭去工作改走歌劇男高音之路，哥哥是男中音，兩位叔叔在安科納 Teatro delle Muse 合唱團唱歌。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franco_Corelli",
            "single": true,
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "他原本在波隆納大學念造船工程，被朋友激將去參加聲樂比賽，雖沒贏，評審鼓勵他走歌唱這條路，他轉入佩薩羅音樂院。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franco_Corelli",
            "src2": "https://www.italyonthisday.com/2016/10/franco-corelli-prince-of-tenors.html",
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "他對音樂院的教學不滿意，後來基本上自學，並模仿 Caruso、Lauri-Volpi、Pertile、Gigli 等人的唱片來學聲音與表情。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franco_Corelli",
            "src2": "https://www.italyonthisday.com/2016/10/franco-corelli-prince-of-tenors.html",
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "1951 年他在佛羅倫斯五月音樂節的比賽勝出，同年在斯波萊托以比才《卡門》的唐荷西登台。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franco_Corelli",
            "src2": "https://www.italyonthisday.com/2016/10/franco-corelli-prince-of-tenors.html",
            "from": "new"
          }
        ]
      },
      "sound": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "他的唱法源自壓低喉頭的技術，他自己改成喉頭「浮動」而不是隨時壓到最低，使聲音在高音區也帶著洞穴般的厚度，同時保有亮度，並能把音量收到弱聲。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franco_Corelli",
            "single": true,
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "巴爾的摩太陽報的訃聞描述他的聲音是華麗豐沛、樂句帶電，常以細微的啜泣感修飾樂句；弱聲細緻，全力唱時則壓倒一切。",
            "src": "https://www.baltimoresun.com/news/bs-xpm-2003-10-31-0310310257-story.html",
            "single": true,
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "樂評人 John Steane 稱他的聲音是自 Lauri-Volpi 以來，那個時代「最獨特、最令人興奮」的聲音之一，並指出他的快速顫音在早年唱片裡比晚年明顯。",
            "src": "https://historyofthetenor.com/franco-corelli/",
            "single": true,
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "他的招牌角色包括《卡門》的唐荷西、《托斯卡》的卡瓦拉多西、《遊唱詩人》的曼里科、《安德烈·謝尼埃》與《杜蘭朵》的卡拉富。",
            "src": "https://www.italyonthisday.com/2016/10/franco-corelli-prince-of-tenors.html",
            "src2": "https://www.baltimoresun.com/news/bs-xpm-2003-10-31-0310310257-story.html",
            "from": "new"
          }
        ]
      },
      "legacy": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "維基稱他以強勁的嗓音、令人屏息的高音與魅力十足的舞台形象聞名，被封為「男高音之王子」（prince of tenors）。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franco_Corelli",
            "src2": "https://www.italyonthisday.com/2016/10/franco-corelli-prince-of-tenors.html",
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "Plácido Domingo 說他是「我現場聽過最令人印象深刻的男高音」。",
            "src": "https://www.baltimoresun.com/news/bs-xpm-2003-10-31-0310310257-story.html",
            "single": true,
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "1953 年他在羅馬歌劇院首度與 Maria Callas 合演《諾瑪》，之後合作多年；Callas 敬重他的演技能與自己匹配。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franco_Corelli",
            "src2": "https://www.italyonthisday.com/2016/10/franco-corelli-prince-of-tenors.html",
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "1961 年他在大都會歌劇院以《遊唱詩人》的曼里科登台，之後約 15 季唱了 19 個角色、約 365 場。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franco_Corelli",
            "src2": "https://www.italyonthisday.com/2016/10/franco-corelli-prince-of-tenors.html",
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "女高音 Birgit Nilsson 回憶 1961 年在波士頓合演《杜蘭朵》時，她的高音 C 撐得比 Corelli 久，讓他大怒，她說有時台上「像鬥牛」，後來兩人成了很好的朋友。",
            "src": "https://www.baltimoresun.com/news/bs-xpm-2003-10-31-0310310257-story.html",
            "single": true,
            "from": "new"
          }
        ]
      },
      "era": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "他 1976 年退休，職業生涯自 1951 年起約 25 年。",
            "src": "https://www.italyonthisday.com/2016/10/franco-corelli-prince-of-tenors.html",
            "src2": "https://www.baltimoresun.com/news/bs-xpm-2003-10-31-0310310257-story.html",
            "from": "new"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "milestones": [
      {
        "f": "1951 年在斯波萊托以《卡門》的唐荷西登台。",
        "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franco_Corelli",
        "src2": "https://www.italyonthisday.com/2016/10/franco-corelli-prince-of-tenors.html",
        "from": "new"
      },
      {
        "f": "1961 年大都會歌劇院首演，唱《遊唱詩人》。",
        "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franco_Corelli",
        "src2": "https://www.baltimoresun.com/news/bs-xpm-2003-10-31-0310310257-story.html",
        "from": "new"
      }
    ],
    "conflicts": [],
