            "f": "Gabriela Ortiz 是墨西哥作曲家，1964 年生於墨西哥市，家境中產、世界眼光開闊。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gabriela_Ortiz",
            "src2": "https://gabrielaortiz.com/2024/09/11/they-said-her-music-was-too-exotic-now-shes-a-classical-star/",
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "她的父母都是墨西哥民謠樂團 Los Folkloristas 的成員，她小時候一邊學古典鋼琴，一邊在家裡彈 charango 與吉他，並隨樂團巡演。",
            "src": "https://gabrielaortiz.com/bio/",
            "src2": "https://gabrielaortiz.com/2024/09/11/they-said-her-music-was-too-exotic-now-shes-a-classical-star/",
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "智利歌手 Víctor Jara 是她家的朋友，成了她少年時的榜樣。",
            "src": "https://gabrielaortiz.com/2024/09/11/they-said-her-music-was-too-exotic-now-shes-a-classical-star/",
            "single": true,
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "她在墨西哥跟 Mario Lavista 學作曲，之後到倫敦求學，在 Guildhall 音樂戲劇學院跟 Robert Saxton 學習，並在倫敦學電聲音樂。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gabriela_Ortiz",
            "src2": "https://gabrielaortiz.com/bio/",
            "from": "new"
          }
        ]
      },
      "sound": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "她自述的音樂把傳統與流行語彙、前衛技法和多媒體並置，墨西哥題材是她持續的靈感來源。",
            "src": "https://gabrielaortiz.com/bio/",
            "single": true,
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "維基列出她的音樂受搖滾、非洲與古巴節奏影響，也寫過電聲實驗作品。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gabriela_Ortiz",
            "single": true,
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "她的音樂節奏感強，大量使用打擊樂器，如 congas、bongos 與牛鈴；在倫敦求學時，有教授要她拿掉節奏脈動，她拒絕，說那就像砍掉自己一隻手臂。",
            "src": "https://gabrielaortiz.com/2024/09/11/they-said-her-music-was-too-exotic-now-shes-a-classical-star/",
            "single": true,
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "《Revolución diamantina》是為八個人聲與管弦樂團寫的芭蕾，靈感來自 2019 年墨西哥反暴力、反女性被殺害的「亮粉遊行」，標題取自抗議者向警方首長潑灑粉紅亮粉。",
            "src": "https://www.berliner-philharmoniker.de/en/programme-notes/gabriela-ortiz-revolucion-diamantina-ballet-for-eight-voices-and-orchestra-concert-version/",
            "src2": "https://www.laphil.com/press/releases/2180",
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "這部作品由作家 Cristina Rivera Garza 與她共同發展詩意的戲劇結構；樂曲分成六個樂章或六幕。",
            "src": "https://www.berliner-philharmoniker.de/en/programme-notes/gabriela-ortiz-revolucion-diamantina-ballet-for-eight-voices-and-orchestra-concert-version/",
            "single": true,
            "from": "new"
          }
        ]
      },
      "legacy": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "她與洛杉磯愛樂和指揮 Gustavo Dudamel 關係緊密，Dudamel 已首演她七部作品，稱她是「天生的天才」。",
            "src": "https://gabrielaortiz.com/2024/09/11/they-said-her-music-was-too-exotic-now-shes-a-classical-star/",
            "single": true,
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "《Revolución diamantina》的錄音在第 67 屆葛萊美獎拿下最佳當代古典作曲，由她本人獲獎；同一張專輯另得最佳管弦樂演出與最佳古典綜合專輯。",
            "src": "https://www.laphil.com/press/releases/2180",
            "src2": "https://gabrielaortiz.com/bio/",
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "她早年被老師批評「太異國」，樂評反對她「蔓生的音響」，頂尖樂團也一度沒委託她。",
            "src": "https://gabrielaortiz.com/2024/09/11/they-said-her-music-was-too-exotic-now-shes-a-classical-star/",
